    "turn_idx": 42,
    "turn_text": "And I think, you know, he put it out, you know, he put it out on social media. And I think that's going to get out there, but I think you're right. I think voters, when they go to the poll, I think that Donald Trump is going to win Ohio by 13 to 14. I really do. And I think Bernie's going to win. I'm not going to say double digits, but I think he's going to do well. So as long as people understand that this is a bad policy, being funded by out of state, out of country actors, I think the Ohio, I think the people in Ohio will realize that they need",
