    "turn_idx": 45,
    "turn_text": "Well, so what I would say is that the Democrats do a really good job of raising money in small dollar numbers. They have this act blue that they put out there. But here's the one thing I got to tell you, you know, I can't take it. I know you have Troy on quite a bit. We can't take foreign money, but when it comes to issue advocacy campaigns, they can take foreign money. So these people that are, you know, living in Switzerland or living in Greece or wherever they are, they know that they can affect Ohio's elections, and this is the way they want to do it. They can't win at the ballot box, so they want to change the rules. And that's what they've done. And if you look at it, I mean it's going to be 16 pages to our Constitution that will mandate that we have to gerrymandered districts in the state, it's insane. and they've done it in michigan there and in",
