    "turn_text": "Hey, did you see Bret Baer and Kamala? I'm sure you did. I'm sure you saw Bret Baer and Kamala and, you know, it feels like some big momentum change happened somewhat with that. And looking back as, you know, hopefully January 20th, you know, Trump will be sworn in again for 47 and he'll take his rightful place inside the White House and so on. But looking back from there, I feel like that's going to be a pivotal point for me if if in fact it happens he and JD ended up going into the and you know president vice president but I feel like that's going to be a big swing right there when you and and I don't know where you were at on that. Josh 100% was behind Brett saying, look, Brett's going to do what he's supposed to do. And there are a lot of people are going, man, I don't know if this guy is going to. And then he came out firing just guns ablaze in which I don't want to forget about that or let that kind of fade because I feel like that is so important in this whole landscape that's happening right now. Feels like the momentum is really, really big in a Trump way.",
