    "turn_text": "yeah i i don't disagree with you on that but here's the one thing i will tell you i mean i you know you know people that watch politics like i have uh... we remember when when she was running for president in the primary what the number years ago and once people started to hear her once people started to interview her she can't you know her donors led everything and i think that's what she's doing but the momentum is clearly on the republican side and i think that again It boils down to three things, in my opinion, border, inflation, and interest rates. No matter how many shows she goes on, those are the things that you just can't debate those. You've got interest rates that are up, you've got inflation that's up, and you've got a border that's like a sieve. It's an easy message. And I think that's what the, I think President Trump has been focused on that. And that's why we're, that's why we're winning in states that we never thought we were going to win it.",
